ame. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item. <br>\u2022 Terms of Service: http://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M9/T1<br>\u2022 Privacy Policy: http://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M9/T3<br><br>\u2022 For questions or customer support, please contact our Customer Support by visiting http://customer-m.withhive.com/ask",
